      "writtenOn": "2026-06-16T17:35:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Changed it to be a bitmask (which we now pass in along with an optional string label rather than having two separate methods, which made more sense perhaps if custom-label textures were treated entirely separately from textures using statically-defined flag representations of usages).\n\nAlso, I combined this method with the other one that accepts a label, so now `findOrCreateScratchTexture` accepts both.",
      "parentUuid": "33fc7bbd_4c0e5837",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 75,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 75,
        "endChar": 70
      },
      "revId": "0add26adaf485ad41ed1ef6cc2f9bf11af2252d3",
